["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">脳</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>脑；记忆</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ノウ・ドウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">のうずる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭脳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ずのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">头脑；大脑；智力；理解力；聪慧</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">のう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脑；大脑；脑子；头脑；智力</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">首脳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅのう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">首脑；领导人；最高层；重要部分；要点</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">極</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>极；极限；极其；极点；结局</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョク・ゴク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きわ.める・きわ.まる・きわ.まり・きわ.み・き.める・-ぎ.め・き.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">極</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ごく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">极其；非常；10^48</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">積極的</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せっきょくてき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">积极的；主动的；进取的；能动的；有为的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">南極</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なんきょく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">南极；南极地区；南极洲</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">含</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>包含；含在口中；理解；怀有（感情等）；包括</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふく.む・ふく.める</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">含む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">包含；包括；含有；容纳；涵盖；含在嘴里；铭记在心；心怀；怀有（怨恨等）；表达；流露（感情等）；暗示</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">含める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふくめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">包括；纳入；告知；使理解；包含（含义）；暗示；放入口中；使充满风味；浸润味道</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">含嗽</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うがい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">漱口；漱喉咙</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">蔵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>仓库；隐藏；拥有；收藏；保管</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゾウ・ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くら・おさ.める・かく.れる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷蔵庫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぞうこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">冷藏柜；冰箱；冷柜</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">貯蔵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょぞう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">贮存；保存；储备；囤积；囤积（不用于生产的商品或金钱）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">蔵</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">仓库；仓房；地窖；弹药库；粮仓；货栈；储藏处；金库；谷仓</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">量</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>量；测量；估计；重量；数量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">量</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">数量；份量；容量；体积；宽宏；宽厚；度量；量（印度哲学中获得准确有效知识的手段）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">重量</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅうりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">重量</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">測量</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そくりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">测量；测地</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">型</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>模型；类型；模具</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かた・-がた</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">型</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かた</span><span class=\"k-wz\">类型；风格；款式；样式；模式；模具；模型；模板；印记；型（武术中的一套固定动作和位置）；风格（歌舞伎、能剧等中的）；形式；惯例；传统；（标准）形式；公式；用法；（规定的）尺寸；英寸（显示屏、磁盘、图像传感器等的尺寸）；（分类学）型</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">典型</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">类型；样式；模式；典范；范例；原型；完美示例</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">模型</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もけい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">模型；假人；雕塑模型</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">況</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>状况；情形</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まし.て・いわ.んや・おもむき</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">状況</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">事态；局面；情况；状况</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">好況</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">景气好；经济繁荣；市场兴旺</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">不況</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">经济衰退；经济萧条；经济不景气</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">針</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>针；大头针；订书钉；刺针</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">針</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">针；别针；钩；螫针；尖刺；棘；针（如钟表等的指针）；订书钉；针线活；缝纫；恶意；敌意；针脚（计数单位）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">針路</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">航向；方向</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">針金</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はりがね</span><span class=\"k-wz\">金属丝；铁丝</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">専</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>专门；主要；专一；独占</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もっぱ.ら</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">専攻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">专业；专攻</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">専制</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">专制；独裁</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">専修</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せんしゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">专修；专业化</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">谷</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>山谷；谷</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たに・きわ.まる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">谷</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たに</span><span class=\"k-wz\">山谷；峡谷；溪谷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">史</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>历史；史书</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">歴史</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れきし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">历史</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">女史</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（高社会地位的）女士（如女学者、女艺术家、女评论家、女政治家等）；女士；夫人；小姐（用作后缀）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">階</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>楼层；楼梯；（建筑物的）层数</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きざはし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">階段</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阶梯；楼梯</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">二階建て</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にかいだて</span><span class=\"k-wz\">两层楼房；二层建筑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">段階</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だんかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阶段；步骤；时期；等级；等次；品级；分级；顺序；台阶；楼梯</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">管</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>管；管辖；管道；管乐器；醉话</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くだ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">管</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">管；管子；管状物；管乐器；（解剖）脉管；导管；（体内的）道、管（如消化道、耳道）；管状物的计数词</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">管理</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">管理；控制</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">血管</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けっかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">血管；静脉</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">兵</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>士兵；军队；战争；军事；战术</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヘイ・ヒョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つわもの</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">兵隊</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいたい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">军队；武装力量；士兵；普通士兵；士卒；下属；普通员工；小人物</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">兵器</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">武器；军械；兵器</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">兵士</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へいし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">士兵；军人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">接</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>接触；连接；拼接；接续；接合</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セツ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つ.ぐ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">直接</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょくせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">直接的；无中介的；亲身的；第一手的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">応接</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">接待；应对</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">間接</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">间接；间接性</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">細</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>细长；细小；精细；瘦削；变细</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほそ.い・ほそ.る・こま.か・こま.かい</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">細い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ほそい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">细的；纤细的；精细的；（台球行话）运气差的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">細かい</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こまかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">细小的；详细的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">細菌</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいきん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">细菌；病菌</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">丸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>圆形；圆满；丸药；弄圆；卷起</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まる・まる.める・まる.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まるい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">圆形的；圆的；球形的；弯曲的；光滑的；和谐的；温和的；平和的；亲切的；友好的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">圆；圆形；整体；全部；完整；钱；金钱；城郭内的围郭区域；鳖；甲鱼；（用于船名、人名（尤指婴儿）、刀剑·铠甲·乐器等名称、犬马等名称的）后缀</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">丸々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まるまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">圆润；丰满；肥胖；完全；彻底；全部</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">湾</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>海湾；港湾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ワン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いりえ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">湾</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">わん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">湾；海湾</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">録</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>记录；记载；录制；抄录</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ロク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しる.す・と.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">記録</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きろく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">记录；文件；会议记录；日志；录音；记载；存档；纪录（如体育比赛）；创纪录；刷新纪录</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">録音</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ろくおん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">录音</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">登録</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">とうろく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">登记；注册；登录；记录；订阅</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">省</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>省（政府机构）；省略；省察</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セイ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">かえり.みる・はぶ.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">省く</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はぶく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">省略；节省</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">省略</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうりゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">省略；略去；缩写；节略；缩短（如名称）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">反省</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はんせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">反省；反思；内省；遗憾；悔改；懊悔；自责</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">旧</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>旧时；旧物；旧友；以前；前任</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふる.い・もと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">旧</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旧；老；前；曾经的；旧物；旧事；旧习；往日；过去的日子；旧历；阴历</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">旧知</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旧友；老相识</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">旧事</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くじ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">往事；陈年旧事</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">橋</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>桥</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">橋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">桥</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">鉄橋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てっきょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">铁路桥；铁桥</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">桟橋</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さんばし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">码头；栈桥；突堤</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">岸</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>海岸；河岸；岸边</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">海岸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいがん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海岸；海滨；滨海；海边；沙滩</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">岸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">岸；河岸；海岸</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿岸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えんがん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">海岸；岸边；沿岸水域；近海水域；沿岸地区</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">周</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>周围；巡回；一圈</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まわ.り</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">周り</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まわり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">周长；圆周；周围；周围；邻近；附近；周边；周围的人；