\">しんりん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">森林；树林</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">競</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>竞争；比赛；竞赛；拍卖；较量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キョウ・ケイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">きそ.う・せ.る・くら.べる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">競争</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">竞争；竞赛；角逐；比赛；竞争（生物体或物种之间）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">競技</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうぎ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">竞技；比赛；竞赛；运动项目</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">競馬</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいば</span><span class=\"k-wz\">赛马；赛马运动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">介</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>介绍；中介；介入；照料；介壳</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">紹介</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">介绍；引见；推荐；展示</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">厄介</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">やっかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；负担；讨厌的事物；烦恼；困扰；照顾；依赖；扶养；恩惠；义务；寄宿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">介護</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいご</span><span class=\"k-wz\">护理；照护；看护；护理服务</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">根</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>根；根部；源头；（青春痘的